! K.frr — Stub AS, customer of C
!
! K has a single upstream connection to provider C (10.1.6.2).
!
! As a stub, K:
!   - Announces only its own prefix (10.255.11.1/32) to C via the 'network' statement.
!   - Accepts all routes from C for global reachability.
!   - Provides no transit to any other AS.
!
! Money logic: K pays C for transit. No other commercial relationships exist.

route-map FROM-PROVIDER permit 10
 set local-preference 100
!
router bgp __ASN__
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  neighbor 10.1.6.2 route-map FROM-PROVIDER in
 exit-address-family
!
